{
  "_说明": [
    "NapCat 的 OneBot11 配置模板。若不想在 WebUI 里点，可以直接用这个文件。",
    "",
    "用法：",
    "  1. 把 token 换成你 .env 里的 ONEBOT_SECRET（必须完全一致）",
    "  2. 把本文件复制成 /opt/napcat/config/onebot11_<你的QQ号>.json",
    "     （文件名里的 QQ 号必须是你登录的那个号，NapCat 按号读配置）",
    "  3. docker restart napcat",
    "",
    "字段依据 NapCat 源码 packages/napcat-onebot/config/config.ts，",
    "删掉本节 _说明 也能正常工作（JSON 里多余的键会被忽略）。"
  ],

  "network": {
    "httpClients": [
      {
        "name": "arcade-queue",
        "enable": true,

        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/onebot",

        "token": "把这里换成你的 ONEBOT_SECRET",

        "messagePostFormat": "array",

        "reportSelfMessage": false,

        "debug": false
      }
    ],
    "httpServers": [],
    "httpSseServers": [],
    "websocketServers": [],
    "websocketClients": [],
    "plugins": []
  },

  "musicSignUrl": "",
  "enableLocalFile2Url": false,
  "parseMultMsg": false,
  "imageDownloadProxy": "",
  "timeout": {
    "baseTimeout": 10000,
    "uploadSpeedKBps": 256,
    "downloadSpeedKBps": 256,
    "maxTimeout": 1800000
  }
}
